A tower is attached to the house, blackened with soot,  
day and night shaken by the firing of rifles.  
What will give the poor soul rest,  
while enemies are all around,  
while the desire for revenge has lodged in the hearts of humankind,  
and many bullets fired by the enemy have struck his chest!
